SUMMARY:Frederick's Oktoberfest
DESCRIPTION:German food\, beer\, wine\, music\, dancing\, and fun! Frederick’s Oktoberfest celebrates our county’s German heritage\, brings friends and neighbors together for a weekend full of good food and drink\, and raises monies to support our community’s many community causes and charities. Zicke zacke\, zicke zacke\, hoi hoi hoi!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/fredericks-oktoberfest/9625/
END:VEVENT
