UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgevent14thannualgravitysocialfallfestivalanddualslalom17437-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261003T143952Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:14th Annual Gravity Social Fall Festival and Dual Slalom
DESCRIPTION:Come check out the 14th Annual Gravity Social Dual Slalom Race & Festival at Old Harmony Farm on October 3rd in Myersville\, Maryland. Join 1\,000+ spectators for Maryland's premier grassroots dual slalom mountain bike race hosted by Gravity Social\, a non-profit dedicated to promoting competitive racing for all ages and experience levels! This unique Frederick County sporting event attracts 200+ racers from across the region to compete head-to-head in thrilling elimination-style races. Perfect for families - enjoy live music\, food trucks\, beer garden\, and onsite camping\, while watching exciting mountain bike racing just 15 minutes from downtown Frederick! Open to all skill levels from striders to pros\, making it a true community celebration of outdoor sports in beautiful Frederick County.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/14th-annual-gravity-social-fall-festival-and-dual-slalom/17437/
END:VEVENT
