UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventforageyourownginwithmcclintockdistilling25996-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261003T143952Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Forage Your Own Gin with McClintock Distilling
DESCRIPTION:Make your own herb-infused gin! In this immersive experience\, you’ll be transported through the history and art of distilling. Then get hands-on to create your very own recipe! A local distiller from McClintock will introduce the art of gin-making through the centuries. You will have the opportunity to sample many styles of craft gins and spirits. Afterward\, we’ll walk the herb garden to harvest fresh herbs and botanicals to create your very own gin to take home and enjoy. Ticket does NOT include a bottle of organic vodka needed to complete your herbal infusion jar. Bottles will be available\, but sold separately for $30. * Must be 21 or over to participate Meet your Teacher Braeden is the co-founder and head distiller of McClintock Distilling. His gin’s have won numerous international awards including Best Gin in Show at the 2020 International Spirits Competition.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/forage-your-own-gin-with-mcclintock-distilling/25996/
END:VEVENT
