SUMMARY:Frederick Book Arts Center Wayzgoose Open House
DESCRIPTION:You read that right\, Wayzgoose! What was once held by a master printer or printshop in celebration of their workers now looks like a community celebration of printing. This will be FBAC's first Wayzgoose and we want to invite you to help us celebrate it\; check out our awesome line up of activities listed below: 11am-2pm - 5 layer letterpress print on 5 different types of presses - Vandercook\, Iron Hand Press\, Chandler and Price Platen Press\, Kelsey Table Top Platen Press\, and Galley Press 11am - 3pm - Jill Cypher and Ray Nichols Letterpress-led project on the Vandercook 2-3pm - Stan Nelson talk about his new book \\
