DTSTAMP:20261003T143952Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Frederick Festival of Flight
DESCRIPTION:The Frederick Municipal Airport is excited to host the fourth annual Frederick Festival of Flight on October 3rd\, 2026! Entry to the event is FREE! The Frederick Municipal Airport\, and our airport users\, invite the Frederick community out to the airport to experience the aircraft that fly here\, the organizations that meet here\, and the businesses that operate here. Experience the Frederick Airport through aircraft on display and in flight\, explore opportunities on how to get involved with aviation\, learn about aviation\, and meet the people and businesses that are based at Frederick. We will also be hosting local food trucks and vendors during the event.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-festival-of-flight/20098/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfrederickminiaturedollhousespectacular22485-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261003T143952Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Frederick Miniature (Dollhouse) Spectacular
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a tiny but mighty experience at the Frederick Miniature Spectacular 2026 - where small things bring big joy! Welcome to the Frederick Miniature Spectacular 2026! Step into a world where everything is delightfully miniature! Join us for an unforgettable day filled with all things miniature at The Grand Social Hall! Whether you’re a longtime miniaturist\, a devoted collector\, a dollhouse enthusiast\, or simply curious about the tiny world we love\, there’s something for everyone to discover. Marvel at beautifully crafted tiny treasures and exquisite miniature décor—with all the special details that make miniature projects come to life. Browse a wonderful selection of unique\, handcrafted pieces from talented miniature artists and vendors\, find inspiration for your next project\, and uncover those perfect little treasures you didn’t even know you needed! Want to create something of your own? Join one of our miniature workshops and try your hand at making your own tiny masterpiece. Workshop space is limited\, so be sure to reserve your spot! Shop • Create • Discover • Be Inspired Come spend the day surrounded by creativity\, craftsmanship\, and a whole lot of tiny magic. Don’t miss this one-of-a-kind miniature event! Children under 10 years get in free along with each paying adult.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-miniature-(dollhouse)-spectacular/22485/
END:VEVENT
