UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventgrowingmushroomswithjaredurchek25995-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261003T143952Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Growing Mushrooms with Jared Urchek
DESCRIPTION:You too can grow mushrooms at home. It’s easier than you think! We’ll will walk you through their process of growing mushrooms step-by-step. Plus\, you’ll receive spawn to start growing your own mushrooms at home. Meet Your Teacher Jared Urchek is a Maryland-based naturalist\, mycologist\, and licensed acupuncturist passionate about foraging and education. For over a decade\, he has led mushroom foraging workshops at Fox Haven\, emphasizing ethical and safe wild harvesting. He also runs Vital Traditions Acupuncture in College Park\, integrating natural health practices into his work.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/growing-mushrooms-with-jared-urchek/25995/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventhispanicheritagefestival17634-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261003T143952Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Hispanic Heritage Festival
DESCRIPTION:In honor of Hispanic Heritage Month each year\, Centro Hispano turns Carrol Creek in Downtown Frederick into a lively\, colorful celebration of Hispanic art\, culture\, and music. The festival\, which takes place annually on the first Saturday of October\, features live music\, dancing and food from a variety of Latin American countries. It's a great way to showcase the richness and diversity of Hispanic culture and to shine a spotlight on the contributions our Hispanic neighbors have made and continue to make to our community. ​Join us for: - Live music\, singing and dancing - Festive costumes - Arts and crafts activities for kids - Great food ​To learn more about the festival or to explore volunteer or sponsorship options\, visit the festival website.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/hispanic-heritage-festival/17634/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventiron26inkmusicfestival26082-20261003@visitfrederick
