SUMMARY:IRON & INK MUSIC FESTIVAL
DESCRIPTION:LET’S ROCK!! 🤘 Frederick\, MD\, get ready to turn it up! IRON & INK MUSIC FESTIVAL is taking over Rockwell Brewery on Saturday\, October 3rd for a full day of live music\, tattoos\, vendors\, merch\, and metalcore! 8 bands\, including Baltimore favorites Dead Eyes\, tattoo artists\, available for all-day ink\, vendors and band merch for plenty of shopping\, craft brews and good food! Doors open at noon\, the music kicks off at 2pm\, and we keep the party going until 11pm! Tickets are only $20 through September 26th! On September 27th\, tickets jump to $30\, so don't wait! Grab your passes now at kapplerpresents.com and reserve seating for you and your crew if you'd like.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/iron-%26-ink-music-festival/26082/
